/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1544388365/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:227:Key insight: The legend piece doubles as both a jigsaw piece and a color key — its internal k×k palette assigns colors by spatial quadrant.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1596874279/8/prompt.md:48:Count the two upper quadrant control regions to size an output made from the lower quadrant pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1596874279/8/prompt.md:51:- The grid is an even square split into four equal quadrants.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1596874279/8/prompt.md:53:- The upper-left and upper-right quadrants are control regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1596874279/8/prompt.md:54:- The lower-left quadrant is a color source tile; the lower-right quadrant is either a stencil tile or empty.
